    "directions": [
      "Load the smoker with sawdust and fire it up following the manufacturer’s instructions.",
      "Hold a brandy snifter upside down. Insert the smoker tube into the glass and fill it with smoke until you can’t see through the glass. Tightly cover the glass with a coaster to hold in the smoke and turn it upright.",
      "Place the ice cubes in a shaker. Add the bourbon, St-Germain, Cointreau, and simple syrup and stir rapidly for about 20 seconds.",
      "Uncover the snifter and immediately strain the cocktail into it. Serve at once, with the smoke still spilling from the glass."
    ],
